<title>USA: No damaging cold seen in Brazil coffee areas - WSC.</title>
<headline>No damaging cold seen in Brazil coffee areas - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON MASS. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for the next five days in Brazil's coffee regions, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The forecast is for mild to warm weather with temperatures normal to slightly above normal.</p>
</text>
